---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="A2 Hosting Review - VPSTier.com" description="A2 Hosting Review: Turbo servers up to 20x faster, free site migration, and developer-friendly VPS plans starting at $5/mo.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/vps" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-orange-500 text-sm mb-6 block">← Back to VPS Reviews</a>
    
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-start justify-between mb-8">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">A2 Hosting Review</h1>
        <div class="flex gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
          <span>Commission: <strong class="text-orange-500">$50-100/sale</strong></span>
          <span>Cookie: <strong>90 days</strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=16299" target="_blank" rel="noopener" 
         class="bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition">
        Visit A2 Hosting →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <span class="text-2xl font-bold">4.2/5</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500">Developer Rating</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">A2 Hosting stands out with their Turbo Server plans offering up to 20x faster page loads compared to standard shared hosting. Great for developers who need speed and have outgrown shared hosting.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Starting at $5/mo</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Turbo servers: up to 20x faster than standard</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Free site migration for new customers</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Anytime money-back guarantee</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ SSH and WP-CLI pre-installed</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 3 global datacenter locations (US, EU, Asia)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-400">Cons</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Higher renewal rates after first term</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No GPU instances available</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Entry-level VPS has limited resources</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No Windows VPS options</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-gray-800 pt-8">
      <a href="https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=16299" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
         class="block text-center bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold transition">
        Sign Up via Our Affiliate Link ($50-100/sale)
      </a>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-500 text-xs mt-3">
        We earn a commission when you sign up through our link. This doesn't affect our review.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
